# Domains (Viselle)

**Production is `viselle.net`, not `viselle.app`.** Never invent or default to `viselle.app` in docs, copy, env examples, emails, or code fallbacks.

| Environment | Frontend | API |
|---|---|---|
| Production | `viselle.net` / `www.viselle.net` | `api.viselle.net` |
| Staging | `staging.viselle.net` | `staging-api.viselle.net` |

Related: paid booking subdomains use `sites.viselle.net` (e.g. `yourspa.sites.viselle.net`). Contact: `hello@viselle.net`.
